{
  "_comment": "Shipped launchable-app registry. Machine-specific install locations are expressed as env-var TOKENS (%LOCALAPPDATA%, %PROGRAMFILES%, %PROGRAMFILES(X86)%, %WINDIR%, ${VAR}, ~) so the SAME file resolves on any machine. Add apps or point a key at a different install via a user overlay (QUILL_DESKTOP_APPS, default ~/.quill/apps.json) — no code edit. Per app: platforms (os.name values that may run it), candidates (probed in order; first that exists wins), optional launch_args (trusted built-in args), capabilities (what the agent may do with it).",

